link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Mind-Claw of Tu'narath</b> is a class action provided by the passive feature <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath\" title=\"Legendary Action: Mind-Claw of Tu'narath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Mind-Claw of Tu'narath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath\" title=\"Legendary Action: Mind-Claw of Tu'narath\">Legendary Action: Mind-Claw of Tu'narath</a>. It summons a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath\" title=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath\">Mind-Claw of Tu'narath</a> directly adjacent to the attacker who triggered the ability.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSummon a vestigial echo of Vlaakith's ire as a wicked psionic blade.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Twice per round\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Twice per round</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_CRE_GithyankiInquisitor_VlaakithsMindSword</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_CRE_GithyankiInquisitor_VlaakithsMindSword\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_CRE_GithyankiInquisitor_VlaakithsMindSword\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> Action trigge