es/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/24px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Size</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>Small</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mindbreak\" title=\"Mindbreak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mindbreak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Generic_Psychic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mindbreak\" title=\"Mindbreak\">Mindbreak</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></sp